{% extends 'pages/_base.jinja' %}


{% block content %}

    <h2>Chocolate</h2>

    <img src="/static/iamges/cake.jpg" alt="Chocolate cake">
    
    <p>This chocolate cake it's an easy,delicious and flufly cake</p>
     <ul>
       <li>Preperation time: 10min</li>
       <li>Cook time: 35min</li>
       <li>Total time: 45min</li>
     </ul>

    <h3>Ingredients</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>1 3/4cup all purpose flour</li>
      <li>3/4 cup cocoa powder</li>
      <li>1 1/2tsp baking soda</li>
      <li>2 cups white sugar</li> 
      <li>1 tsp salt</li>
      <li>2 eggs</li>  
      <li>1 cup milk</li>
      <li>1/2 cup vegetable oil</li>
      <li>2 tsp vanilla extract</li>
      <li>1 cup boling water</li> 
    </ul>

    <h4>Instructions</h4>

    <ol>
      <li>Preheat the oven to 180C°</li>
      <li>Sift flour, cocoa, baking powder and baking soda into a large bowl. Add sugar and salt. Whisk briefly to combine. </li>
      <li>Add eggs ,milk, oil and vanilla. Whisk well to combine until lump free: about 30seconds. </li>
      <li>Add boiling water and whisk to incorporate. The battler is VERY thin.</li>
      <li>Pour battler into cake pans.</li>
    </ol>
    
    <h5>BAKING</h5>
    <ol>
    <li>Bake for 35min or until a wooden shewer inserted into the centre comes out clean.</li>
    <li>Cool for 10min, then turn out onto wire racks upside down</li>
    <li>Cool completely before frosting.</li>
    </ol>


{% endblock %}

